# Materials for beacon.obj.
#
# Three materials chosen to be told apart at a glance: a dark diffuse base, a
# sharp warm metal, and a pale head with an emissive term. Kd is what the
# renderer reads today; Ka, Ks, Ns and Ke are parsed and carried whether or not
# a given shader has a uniform for them.

newmtl Slate
Ka 0.050 0.050 0.060
Kd 0.280 0.300 0.340
Ks 0.100 0.100 0.120
Ns 12.0
d 1.0
illum 2

newmtl Brass
Ka 0.080 0.060 0.020
Kd 0.780 0.600 0.220
Ks 0.900 0.800 0.450
Ns 96.0
d 1.0
illum 2

newmtl Lamp
Ka 0.200 0.180 0.100
Kd 0.950 0.850 0.450
Ks 0.300 0.300 0.300
Ke 0.600 0.500 0.200
Ns 4.0
d 1.0
illum 2
